      "severity": "low",
      "spec_quote": "When `worldTick MOD progress_period = 0`",
      "state": "open",
      "why": "AGENTS.md rule 5 requires guarding every MOD; progress_period is a tunable param, not a literal."
    },
    {
      "component": "C.take_heart",
      "decision": "Read controlX/controlY(objective) without checking objective >= 0. For an invalid objective, the host returns -1 and the engine clamps the resulting goal.",
