      "severity": "low",
      "spec_quote": "`hx = controlX(objective)`",
      "state": "open",
      "why": "The spec still omits this guard for the coordinate reads, and invalid objective indices return -1 without a runtime error. The new finish_capture condition separately requires objective >= 0."
